## 17. Comandos de verificación

### CloudWatch Observability

``` bash
aws eks describe-addon   --cluster-name pet-adoption-eks   --addon-name amazon-cloudwatch-observability   --region us-east-1   --query "addon.status"   --output text
```

Resultado esperado:

``` text
ACTIVE
```

### Pods de CloudWatch

``` bash
kubectl get pods -n amazon-cloudwatch
```

### Métricas Container Insights

``` bash
aws cloudwatch list-metrics   --namespace ContainerInsights   --region us-east-1   --dimensions Name=ClusterName,Value=pet-adoption-eks   --query "Metrics[].MetricName"   --output text
```

### Logs de la API

``` bash
aws logs describe-log-streams   --log-group-name "/aws/containerinsights/pet-adoption-eks/application"   --region us-east-1   --query "logStreams[?contains(logStreamName, 'pet-adoption')].logStreamName"   --output text
```

### Caché

``` http
GET /api/v2/cache/metrics
```